@startuml
skinparam defaultFontSize 22
skinparam nodesep 10
skinparam ranksep 20
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam packageStyle rect

package "Presentation Layer (MVVM)" {
    component [Jetpack Compose UI\n(LoginScreen)] as View
    component [ViewModel\n(AuthViewModel)] as VM
}

package "Domain Layer (Clean Architecture)" {
    component [Use Cases\n(LoginUseCase)] as UC
    interface "Repository Interface\n(AuthRepository)" as RepoInt
}

package "Data Layer" {
    component [Repository Impl\n(AuthRepositoryImpl)] as RepoImpl
    component [Remote Data Source\n(AuthApi - OkHttp)] as Remote
    component [Local Data Source\n(TokenDataStore)] as Local
}

database "Backend API" as BE

' UI Events flow (downwards)
View --> VM : 1. Dispatch UI Events\n(e.g., loginClicked)

VM --> UC : 2. Call Execute\n(credentials)

UC --> RepoInt : 3. Request Data

RepoInt <|.. RepoImpl : Realizes

RepoImpl --> Remote : 4. Fetch / Send
RepoImpl --> Local : 5. Read / Write

Remote --> BE : 6. HTTP Request / Response

' Data / State updates flow (upwards)
BE ..> Remote : JSON Data
Remote ..> RepoImpl : DTO / Domain Model
Local ..> RepoImpl : Token

RepoImpl ..> UC : Domain Entities
UC ..> VM : Result / State

VM --> View : 7. Expose State via StateFlow\n(Triggers Re-composition)

@enduml
